{
  "protocol": "archive-fixture/1",
  "description": "Synthetic records that cite every contract in the specification's catalog except the specification upgrade, which Door refuses. fixture/build.py admits them through the real Door into a fresh archive (ADR 0059). Every label, title, and byte is invented.",
